        "minutes": 3,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Play below to start the drone on A. Bend {{4}} up to {{5}} again and hold it at the top. When the bend arrives, the held note and the drone sound steady together; while the bend is short, they sound rough."
